	 (7,'alpha_vantage','BBWI','Bath & Body Works Inc.','NYSE','USD','USA','CONSUMER CYCLICAL','SPECIALTY RETAIL','Bath & Body Works Inc. (BBWI) is a leading specialty retailer known for its high-quality personal care products, including fragrances, skincare, body care, and home fragrance offerings. With a strong brand identity and a loyal customer base, the company operates a robust network of both physical and online stores, providing an engaging shopping experience. Bath & Body Works focuses on innovation in product development and seasonal marketing, allowing it to effectively respond to consumer trends and preferences. As a part of L Brands, Inc., the company benefits from shared resources and strategic initiatives that enhance its competitive position in the retail market. With a commitment to sustainable practices and community engagement, Bath & Body Works is well-positioned for growth in the dynamic beauty and personal care industry.','https://www.bbwinc.com','January','701985',4713448000,7.08,3.23,0.0357,24.62,'{"CIK": "701985", "EPS": "3.23", "Beta": "1.458", "Name": "Bath & Body Works Inc.", "EBITDA": "1482000000", "Sector": "CONSUMER CYCLICAL", "Symbol": "BBWI", "Address": "THREE LIMITED PARKWAY, COLUMBUS, OH, UNITED STATES, 43230", "Country": "USA", "PERatio": "7.08", "Currency": "USD", "Exchange": "NYSE", "Industry": "SPECIALTY RETAIL", "PEGRatio": "1.162", "52WeekLow": "14.28", "AssetType": "Common Stock", "BookValue": "-7.77", "ForwardPE": "6.97", "52WeekHigh": "40.75", "EVToEBITDA": "6.28", "RevenueTTM": "7354000000", "TrailingPE": "7.08", "Description": "Bath & Body Works Inc. (BBWI) is a leading specialty retailer known for its high-quality personal care products, including fragrances, skincare, body care, and home fragrance offerings. With a strong brand identity and a loyal customer base, the company operates a robust network of both physical and online stores, providing an engaging shopping experience. Bath & Body Works focuses on innovation in p